@startuml
|Depot Laptop|
start
:Member arrives with produce;
:Weigh produce on scale;
:Record intake (type, weight, grade, price);
:Update member balance locally;
:Print carbon-copy receipt for member;

if (4G signal available?) then (yes)
  :Sync intake record to town office;
  |Town Office|
  :Receive record;
  :Check for duplicate intakeId;
  if (Duplicate?) then (yes)
    :Log warning, skip;
  else (no)
    :Import into central ledger;
  endif
  |Depot Laptop|
  :Confirm sync complete;
else (no)
  :Queue record in local outbox;
  :Display "OFFLINE – queued for sync";
  note right
    Clerk can still:
    • Record all intakes
    • Print receipts
    • View local member balances
    • Generate daily summary
    Data syncs via USB when
    clerk visits town office.
  end note
  :Continue recording next member;
  :On USB transfer to town office,
  import batch, skip duplicates by intakeId;
  |Town Office|
  :Import batch from USB;
  :Deduplicate by intakeId;
endif

stop
@enduml   